---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Psychotherapy Services | Nepal Hypnosis" description="Confidential and individualized psychotherapy services in Kathmandu tailored to your unique emotional needs, life history, and goals.">
  <main class="py-16 bg-[#FAF8F5]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-[#e2e8f0]">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase mb-3 block">Clinical Practice</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-6">Psychotherapy Services</h1>
      
      <div class="prose max-w-none text-[#475569] space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-[#173A7A]">
          Psychotherapy provides a confidential, structured, and compassionate space to explore emotional difficulties, recurring patterns, and life challenges.
        </p>
        <p>
          At Nepal Hypnosis, we do not believe in a one-size-fits-all model. Every individual carries a unique narrative shaped by their background, relationships, and environment. Our eclectic and evidence-informed approach adapts psychotherapy to fit your specific needs.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 bg-[#F5F1EA] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-2">Ready to take the next step?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4">Reach out for a confidential initial consultation.</p>
          <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">
            Request a Consultation →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>